<Base title="About Us — DreamAuthentics">
  <section class="section" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0f1d3d,#0a1226)">
    <div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;max-width:860px">
      <span class="eyebrow">Defining The Personal Video Arcade Since 2000</span>
      <h2>About DreamAuthentics</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--mut);font-size:1.15rem">The company that built the custom home arcade industry — one dream machine at a time.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap prose">
    <p>DreamAuthentics is the world's premiere custom arcade design and manufacturing company. Since the year 2000, we've defined the personal custom arcade industry — transforming people's video-game dreams into reality with commercially-built, multi-game personalized retro arcade machines that look as incredible as they play.</p>
    <h3>Not a kit. A dream machine.</h3>
    <p>A capable AV integrator or a freelance builder can put a screen in a box. What they can't give you is what sits underneath every DreamAuthentics cabinet: years of engineering into the controls, the artwork process, the game library, and the commercial-grade build quality that has kept our machines running in homes, businesses, and events for two decades.</p>
    <p>Every cabinet is hand-built and finished with fully-custom art — from the six signature models to one-of-a-kind commissions. Hundreds of classic titles, museum-grade cabinet artwork, and controls built to survive years of head-to-head play.</p>
    <h3>As seen everywhere</h3>
    <p>Our arcades have been featured across national television and the biggest names in print — FOX, CBS, MTV, HGTV, G4, Good Morning America, Rolling Stone, Fortune, Playboy, Billboard, Gizmodo and dozens more. See the full story on our <a href="/press/">Press &amp; Media</a> page.</p>
    <h3>Ready to build yours?</h3>
    <p>Browse the <a href="/arcades/">cabinets</a>, explore the <a href="/portfolio/">design art portfolio</a>, or <a href="/contact/">request a quote</a> and we'll design a machine around exactly how you play. Call us any time at <a href="tel:8007898424">800-789-8424</a>.</p>
    <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:30px"><a class="btn" href="/contact/">Request a Quote</a></p>
  </div></section>
</Base>
